Test JSON injection on the login endpoint with these specific test cases:

1. Send a POST request to http://web.chal.csaw.io:3000/login with Content-Type: application/json and this payload:
{"username": {"username": "admin"}}

2. If that doesn't work, try:
{"username": {"$toString": "admin"}}

3. And also try:
{"username": {"search": "admin"}}

Use curl for these requests and analyze the responses carefully, noting any error messages or changes in behavior. Pay special attention to how the server handles object-based input for the username field.

